meta {
  name: Create Milestone
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/milestones
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "title": "Acquire First 100 Paying Indian Customers",
    "description": "Launch B2B sales outreach and convert free tier accounts.",
    "dueDate": "2027-01-31",
    "startupId": "stp_101",
    "budgetINR": 150000
  }
}

docs {
  # Create Milestone
  Add a new roadmap milestone for tracking incubation progress.

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `201` - Milestone created.
  - `400` - Missing required title or startup ID.

  ### Response Example (201)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "milestone": {
      "id": "mls_2",
      "title": "Acquire First 100 Paying Indian Customers",
      "completed": false
    }
  }
  ```
}
